  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your familiarity with certain manifestations allows you to pack more into the voidmeld etherheart than others.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Favored Manifestation, ability to use the voidmeld etherheart</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When adding manifestations to a voidmeld etherheart, the maximum number of manifestation levels worth of manifestations that can be added is increased by +1 if one or more of those manifestations has had the Favored Manifestaton feat applied to it.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Any number of manifestations can be added to a voidmeld etherheart, so long as the sum of their manifestation levels are equal to or less than the highest manifestation level the ethermagus knows.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ethermagic-feats#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
